cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "hana-evals: evaluation for long agent jobs with calibrated judges"
abstract: >-
  Evaluation for long agent jobs: multi-stage jobs run many times and scored at every stage, check placement by
  propagated error cost, fault injection, pass^k, verifier perturbation testing, and model judges calibrated against
  human labels whose error is carried into the reported interval.
version: 0.6.0
date-released: 2026-10-14
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/hanaml-lab/hana-evals"
url: "https://hanaml.com/research/trustworthy-evals"
authors:
  - name: "hanaML"
keywords:
  - evaluation
  - agents
  - llm-as-judge
  - calibration
  - pass-k
  - reward-hacking
references:
